  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Here, we have&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#957;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><msup><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>b</mi></msup><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi></msup></math></p><p>Equating the dimensions of each quantity on both sides</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></mfenced><mi>a</mi></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><msup><mi>L</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>b</mi></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>L</mi><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mi>L</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mi>c</mi></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Comparing the dimensions, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p>Thus, the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi></math> are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>",
